# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHMO_0000208> (reflection method)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0640-0422") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHMO_0000208> "Any method for determining structure where the change in direction or intensity of reflected radiation or particles is detected.")
